---
// Case study section: Easy for the team to edit
// Markup ported word for word from the original case-study.html.
---
<section class="section_case-study-build" data-pane="case-study">
      <div class="section-frame"><div class="section-card">
        <div class="padding-global padding-section-medium"><div class="container-large">
          <div class="case-study_block-content is-wide" data-anim="">
            <span class="text-style-eyebrow text-color-brand">12 · Build</span>
            <h2 class="heading-style-h3">Easy for the team to edit</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="card_list" data-anim-group="">
            <div class="card_component"><p class="heading-style-h4">Webflow and Client-First</p><p class="text-color-secondary">Built from the Longevity template's visual system, with the code rewritten in Client-First classes.</p></div>
            <div class="card_component"><p class="heading-style-h4">Finsweet</p><p class="text-color-secondary">Attributes for the accordion, modals, counter and slider, and Cookie Consent for the banner, all editable without code.</p></div>
            <div class="card_component"><p class="heading-style-h4">Motion</p><p class="text-color-secondary">Entrances, hero art, bars and the founder photo are Webflow Interactions, editable in the Designer with no custom code.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div></div>
      </div></div>
    </section>
